{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-f-and-f-home-valentines-youll-do-xl-mug-2602-0098","content_id":"30b8c26f-b425-4fb5-966c-b4251204fcbf","description":"Product Recall for F&F Home Valentine's 'You'll Do' XL Mug presenting a risk of burns.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"2d87fa7f-0da2-4edb-bff0-b17fa000a09a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-02-11T22:09:48+00:00","id":"2d87fa7f-0da2-4edb-bff0-b17fa000a09a","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-02-11T22:09:48+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698cfe2cbb6023ea0f7123e1/2602-0098-product-recall-F_F-valentines-mug.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: F&amp;F Home Valentine’s ‘You’ll Do’ XL Mug</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of burns as it is possible for the mug to crack when boiling water is poured into it.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by Tesco.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Kitchen/cooking accessories - Mugs/Cups (Non-Disposable)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>F&amp;F Home</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>5063446721248</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batches</td>\n      <td>All Batches</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Hong Kong</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Black mug with white ‘you’ll do’ text, and red heart.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_2d87fa7f-0da2-4edb-bff0-b17fa000a09a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698cfe2cbb6023ea0f7123e1/2602-0098-product-recall-F_F-valentines-mug.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of burns as it is possible for the mug to crack when boiling water is poured into it, leaking hot liquid onto the user.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by Tesco.\nWe recommend owners stop using the product immediately and return the product to your local Tesco store for a full refund.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access the Tesco recall page (<a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://digitalcontent.api.tesco.com/v2/media/homepage/329162a1-a22f-449f-a844-bf0eb011d829/2649-WF-FF-Valentines+Mug.pdf?_gl=1*1j6qqq3*_up*MQ..*_ga*NDYxMzEwMTE4LjE3NzA3NTY1MjY.*_ga_33B19D36CY*czE3NzA3NTY1MjYkbzEkZzAkdDE3NzA3NTY1MzgkajQ4JGwwJGg3MzM2NjkzOA..\">Tesco Valentine’s Mug Recall</a>) or contact Tesco Customer Services on 1800 248 123.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2602-0098</p>\n\n<p>Lead Authority: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-02-11T22:12:23Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"kitchen-cooking-accessories","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-02-11","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at"